#v(40pt)

#only("1-")[- Separates effect of price change into substitution and income effects 💰]
#only("1")[#voiceover("Slutsky Decomposition separates the effect of a price change into substitution and income effects.")]

#v(20pt)

#only("2-")[- Substitution effect: change in consumption due to relative price change 🔄]
#only("2")[#voiceover("The substitution effect is the change in consumption resulting from a change in the relative prices of goods, holding utility constant.")]

#v(20pt)

#only("3-")[- Income effect: change in consumption due to real income change 💸]
#only("3")[#voiceover("The income effect is the change in consumption due to the change in the consumer's real income, resulting from the price change.")]
]

#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Slutsky Decomposition Recap 🎓]

#v(40pt)

#only("1-")[- Total effect = Substitution effect + Income effect 🧮]
#only("1")[#voiceover("The total effect of a price change is the sum of the substitution effect and the income effect.")]

#v(20pt)

#only("2-")[- Useful for analyzing consumer behavior in real-world scenarios 🌍]
#only("2")[#voiceover("Slutsky Decomposition is a valuable tool for analyzing consumer behavior in response to price changes in real-world scenarios.")]

